  "accounting": {
   "net_sum_mbps": 0.0,
   "note": "delta_r counts the bits a decision moved from the link it should have taken to the link it actually took. It is a per-decision attribution, NOT end-to-end rerouted net traffic: later hops of the same packet can correct it. Every flip contributes one + and one -, so sum_r delta_r = 0 and sum_r |delta_r| counts each moved bit twice.",
